{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39580","headline":"御命归乡蒙赐锦衣 · 翁承赞","name":"御命归乡蒙赐锦衣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九重宣旨下丹墀，面对天颜赐锦衣。\n中使擎来三殿晓，宝箱开处五云飞。\n德音耳聆君恩重，金印腰悬已力微。\n更待临轩陈鼓吹，星轺便指故乡归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}